## qf-arts | Quick-fire: art and music | arts | 0 | - | ar-art2
quiz 2 | Who painted the Sistine Chapel ceiling?
* Michelangelo
o Raphael
o Leonardo da Vinci
o Botticelli
= 1508–1512, mostly standing, head tilted back (not lying down, despite the legend).
