quiz 3 | How many symphonies did Beethoven complete?
* 9
o 5
o 12
o 41
= Mozart wrote 41.
> Next

quiz 3 | Which art movement is Salvador Dalí associated with?
* Surrealism
o Cubism
o Impressionism
o Pop Art
= The Persistence of Memory (1931) has the melting clocks.
