quiz 3 | What is a palindrome?
* A word or phrase that reads the same backwards
o A word with opposite meanings
o A rhyming couplet
o A made-up word
= "A man, a plan, a canal: Panama."
> Next

quiz 3 | Which alphabet is used to write Russian?
* Cyrillic
o Latin
o Greek
o Glagolitic only
= Developed from Greek letters in the 9th–10th centuries.
